.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history

# Real weekly journal entries describe real people and real work.
# Keep them out of the repo (especially if public). The README and the
# fictional example-week.md are intentionally tracked.
journal/[0-9]*-week.md

# Video / large media. Host these externally (LinkedIn, YouTube, or a
# GitHub Release asset) and link from the README — don't bloat git history.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
